---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Paver Blocks"
  description="Find out which cookies and similar technologies are involved when you use the Paver Blocks website, including the spam-protection service on our quotation form."
  canonical="https://paver-blocks.pages.dev/cookie-policy/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Cookies &amp; Similar Technologies</p>
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p>What cookies and similar technologies are involved when you visit the Paver Blocks website, and the choices you have.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="policy-wrap">
    <div class="policy-meta">
      <span><strong>Effective date:</strong> 12 November 2026</span>
      <span><strong>Last updated:</strong> 12 November 2026</span>
    </div>

    <aside class="policy-callout">
      <strong>In short:</strong> our website’s own pages do not set cookies or use your browser’s local storage, and we do not use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies or pixels. The online quotation form uses a third-party spam-protection service, Cloudflare Turnstile, which is described below.
    </aside>

    <article class="policy-content">
      <h2>1. About this policy</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files that a website or service can store on your device. Similar technologies, such as browser local storage, can also keep information on your device or help a service recognise your browser. They are commonly used to make websites work, to keep them secure, to remember choices and to measure how a site is used.</p>
      <p>This policy explains which of these technologies are involved when you use the Paver Blocks website. It should be read together with our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>, which explains how we handle personal information.</p>

      <h2>2. What our own website does</h2>
      <p>The pages of this website do not set their own cookies and do not store information in your browser’s local storage or session storage.</p>
      <p>We do not currently use analytics tools, advertising or remarketing pixels, social-media tracking scripts or other tracking technologies on this website.</p>

      <h2>3. Third-party services involved</h2>
      <h3>Cloudflare Turnstile (spam protection)</h3>
      <p>When the online quotation form is displayed on the <a href="/get-a-quote/">Get a Quote</a> page, the page loads Cloudflare Turnstile. It is used to help tell people from automated programs and to reduce spam and abuse of the form. It is not loaded on our other pages.</p>
      <p>Cloudflare processes technical signals for this purpose, such as your IP address, browser details and how the check is completed. Cloudflare describes these signals as strictly necessary for detecting and blocking bots, and it explains any cookies or similar technologies it uses in its own documents. Those technologies are controlled by Cloudflare, and we have not listed them here. We have not enabled Turnstile’s optional Pre-Clearance feature.</p>
      <p>For more information, see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/en-gb/turnstile-privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare’s Turnstile Privacy Addendum</a>, <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare’s Privacy Policy</a> and the <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Turnstile documentation</a>.</p>

      <h3>Website hosting and security</h3>
      <p>This website is delivered and protected through Cloudflare. Cloudflare may process technical information, such as your IP address and request details, to deliver and secure the website, and may use technical cookies or similar technologies for security where needed. We do not control these technologies.</p>

      <h3>Links to other services</h3>
      <p>If you choose to contact us through WhatsApp, you will be taken to WhatsApp’s own service, which applies its own cookie and privacy practices. Telephone and email links open the relevant application on your device. We are not responsible for how third-party services use cookies or similar technologies.</p>

      <h2>4. Analytics and advertising</h2>
      <p>We do not currently use analytics or advertising technologies on this website. If we add them in future, we will update this page to name the provider and the purpose and, where applicable law requires your agreement before non-essential cookies or similar technologies are used, we will ask for it first.</p>

      <h2>5. Your choices</h2>
      <p>Most browsers let you view, block or delete cookies and local storage through their settings. Instructions differ by browser, so please check your browser’s help pages.</p>
      <p>If you block technologies that the Turnstile spam-protection check relies on, the online quotation form may not work. You can still contact us by <a href="https://wa.me/923162753210">WhatsApp</a>, by telephone on <a href="tel:+923162753210">+92 316 2753210</a> or by email at <a href="mailto:hellopaverblocks@gmail.com">hellopaverblocks@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy when our website, the services it uses or legal requirements change. The “Last updated” date at the top of this page shows when the current version was published.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this policy, contact:</p>
      <p><strong>Paver Blocks — Privacy Enquiries</strong><br />
      By Mithal Shahan, Civil Contractor<br />
      Hyderabad, Sindh, Pakistan<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:hellopaverblocks@gmail.com">hellopaverblocks@gmail.com</a><br />
      Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+923162753210">+92 316 2753210</a></p>
    </article>

    <div class="policy-bottom">
      <p>Questions about cookies or how your information is handled?</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:hellopaverblocks@gmail.com?subject=Cookie%20Policy%20Question">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .policy-wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:54px max(5vw,22px) 76px}
  .policy-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 26px;padding-bottom:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e8ee;color:#667386;font-size:14px}
  .policy-meta strong{color:#172B45}
  .policy-callout{margin:24px 0;padding:18px 20px;border-left:4px solid #F5C542;border-radius:5px;background:#F4F6F8;color:#435166;font-size:14px}
  .policy-content{padding-top:8px}
  .policy-content h2{margin:34px 0 10px;color:#172B45;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .policy-content h3{margin:22px 0 6px;color:#172B45;font-size:18px;line-height:1.35}
  .policy-content p,.policy-content li{color:#536174;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}
  .policy-content a{color:#8A6500;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .policy-content a:hover{color:#172B45}
  .policy-bottom{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-top:42px;padding:24px;border-radius:10px;background:#F4F6F8}
  .policy-bottom p{margin:0;color:#172B45;font-weight:750}
  .policy-bottom .button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;background:#F5C542;color:#172B45;font-weight:800}
  @media(max-width:600px){.policy-wrap{padding-top:36px;padding-bottom:54px}.policy-content h2{font-size:20px}.policy-content h3{font-size:17px}.policy-content p,.policy-content li{font-size:14px}.policy-bottom{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}}
</style>
